      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "There must only be one StageParam object you use for your entire avatar. This object must be used in all menus/submenus that you use on that avatar. We may add validation for this in a later version of the SDK.\nFor using the state of multiple submenus, you can use a single Stage param to indicate \"where\" in the tree of submenus you are, such as depth.\nAlternately, you don't have to set a parameter when you go into a submenu. It is optional.",
